      "content": "it just feels like a losing battle. it's not just \"hard,\" it's like the whole world is designed to make sure i never actually get to exist as myself. i look at people who are just... happy, and it feels like they're living in a different reality. i'm just so done with the constant effort. it feels like there's no point in even trying to find that \"support\" if the world itself is the problem.",
